// fn nativeReadFileTail (lines 985-1227). DEFECT: async -> synchronous.
// Same policy gate / EISDIR / empty handling as nativeReadFile. Token
// budget identical (default 4000, headroom 3000, unknown cap 32000).
// targetLinesCount default 100 (cap 1000). Reads BACKWARD from EOF in
// 64 KiB chunks via open/read at offsets until targetLines+1 newlines or
// maxBytes consumed; drops partial first line when not at file start;
