// accumulating lines until token/byte budget (tokenCapped notice prefix).
// Numbering: real line numbers when start-of-file reached, else negative
// "-k" numbers. Header "[File: ... | Mode: Tail reading]" variants per
// source. Binary (NUL in first 4096 of tail) -> binary notice. ENOENT ->
// same exists:false JSON; errors -> "read_file_tail failed: <msg>".
// DEFECT: fs FileHandle positional reads -> sa_std_fs seek/read externs;
// DEFECT: Buffer.concat/subarray -> scratch buffer assembly.
